CommitDate: Mon Oct 26 13:30:02 2026 -0400

    fix: correct GPU logistic gradients at zero logits
    
    The maximum/abs BCE composition gives the wrong autodiff derivative at zero in pinned MLX. Use smooth log-add-exp so zero-initialized logistic models receive sigmoid(logit) minus target gradients. Preserve CPU math, Float GPU routing, public interfaces and stored-parameter prediction.
    
    Add analytic loss and first-update regressions and check GPU finite-step training against independent NumPy/SciPy expectations. Document the intentional correction to old GPU trajectories.

